g busy late-game combat, especially when large numbers of damage indicators are appearing. Reduced frame stalls by reusing the capped damage-number presentation and reducing combat-time allocations. Optimized wound setup and background Soul Crystal status and save work. Preserved the current look and feel, including combat timing, damage-number behavior, visual","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T01:23:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814438965","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085820-1842212951297676","game_id":"steam-5085820","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.28.2 — Clearer Decisions, Cleaner Campaign","summary":"Today's free Demo update brings its interface in line with the latest production build of Idle Necronomics. Clearer Campaign decisions The Campaign screen now separates the current run, next boss, active power, permanent progress, and run profile into distinct cards. Achievement cards also have dedicated space for their title, requirement, current value, and progress gauge, making long-term goals much easier to scan. A cleaner Soul Exchange The Soul Exchange now presents liquid Souls, invested c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:27:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297676","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085820-1841579228672547","game_id":"steam-5085820","kind":"update","title":"# Demo Update 0.25.4 — Steam Achievements and Controller Support","summary":"The Demo now has six achievements covering its core progression:- **First Collection** — Reap your first enemy.- **Vessel Keeper** — Reap 100 enemies.- **Four Thousand Names** — Reap 4,000 enemies.- **Soul Accountant** — Earn 1,000 lifetime Souls.- **Soul Billionaire** — Earn 1 billion lifetime Souls.- **The Crownward Falls** — Defeat the boss of Floor 10.### Better controller and Steam Deck playThe controller path has been rebuilt around visible focus and deliberateselection. The D-pad moves be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T01:34:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672547","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085820-1841579228667584","game_id":"steam-5085820","kind":"update","title":"# Demo Update 0.22.2 — A Faster Start and Visible Soul Reaping","summary":"Today's free Demo update sharpens the opening minutes of Idle Necronomics. You can now begin reaping immediately from the title screen. New Demo players enter the campaign directly, while returning players can continue their current run without an extra save-selection step. The most visible change happens on every kill: Souls now rise from the defeated body and travel into the Soul Vessel. The reward was always part of the economy; now the battlefield actually shows you claiming it. The Floor-10","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T05:34:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5085820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5085820":"2026-10-26T08:01:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5085820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_